{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-14","kind":"proposition","title":"邻补角逆定理：两角和为平角则共线","englishTitle":"If with any straight line, and at a point on it, two straight lines not lying on the same side make the adjacent angles equal to two right angles, the two straight lines will be in a straight line with one another.","book":1,"number":14,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.14","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.14/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":14,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-14@raw-8b836392cfbe66b7","contentId":"euclid-1-14","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8b836392cfbe66b7eb5fcb762ac03225e6f525715d32b125b899bb28421b414c","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-14.statement","euclid-1-14.proof.1","euclid-1-14.proof.2","euclid-1-14.proof.3","euclid-1-14.proof.4","euclid-1-14.construction.1","euclid-1-14.proof.5","euclid-1-14.proof.6","euclid-1-14.conclusion","euclid-1-14.historical.1","euclid-1-14.historical.2","euclid-1-14.historical.3","euclid-1-14.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-14.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-14","revisionId":"euclid-1-14@raw-8b836392cfbe66b7","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c2d6cbbc2f76288388827565d1f282a817bbfd4c53f35805a895d1c5080c6a8e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If with any straight line, and at a point on it, two straight lines not lying on the same side make the adjacent angles equal to two right angles, the two straight lines will be in a straight line with one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果有一条直线,在一条线上,两条不在同一侧的直线使相邻的角等于两条直角,两条直线将彼此相邻的直线。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一直线于线上一点出不同方两直线偕元线每旁作两角若每旁两角与两直角等即后出两线为一直线"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从同一条线上某一点向不同方向画一条直线。如果这两条直线和原来的直线在每一侧形成两个角，并且每一侧的两个角等于两个直角，那么后来出现的两条线是直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-14.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-14","revisionId":"euclid-1-14@raw-8b836392cfbe66b7","order":1,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2e629a7fc6ca7450dd88d697f51c78bc275a41c2628009afc7d7149191f0898f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For with any straight line AB, and at the point B on it, let the two straight lines BC, BD not lying on the same side make the adjacent angles ABC, ABD equal to two right angles;"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"任何一条AB线,在B点,两条BC线,BD线不在同一侧,使相邻角为ABC、ABD等同于2 直角;"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-14.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-14","revisionId":"euclid-1-14@raw-8b836392cfbe66b7","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6a6980ec957fc72ad65157e933e47e39c5a8bed63e7e2bf5473536f4380f6d7c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that BD is in a straight line with CB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说BD是CB直线"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-14.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-14","revisionId":"euclid-1-14@raw-8b836392cfbe66b7","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6af000754197d398aa0fc4ea69247f89ffa8f59ef144a23471528a73e680fe69","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if BD is not in a straight line with BC, let BE be in a straight line with CB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果BD没有BC直线,BE直线CB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-14.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-14","revisionId":"euclid-1-14@raw-8b836392cfbe66b7","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5ef8591c9dec81ba63530a0aff807661c4a97041ab10d085ae23791ee26a550d","citations":["euclid-1-13","euclid-1-post-4","euclid-1-cn-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since the straight line AB stands on the straight line CBE, the angles ABC, ABE are equal to two right angles. [[I. 13](/principles/euclid-1-13)] But the angles ABC, ABD are also equal to two right angles; therefore the angles CBA, ABE are equal to the angles CBA, ABD. [[Post. 4](/principles/euclid-1-post-4) and [C.N. 1](/principles/euclid-1-cn-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB线直线位于CBE线,ABC、ABE角等于2 直角。但ABC、ABD角也等于2 直角;因此,CBA、ABE角等于CBA、ABD角  [ [[I. 13](/principles/euclid-1-13)] [Post. 4](/principles/euclid-1-post-4) [C.N. 1](/principles/euclid-1-cn-1)"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-14.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-14","revisionId":"euclid-1-14@raw-8b836392cfbe66b7","order":5,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8c0f1135f4a27b03c8cc513fd72f3b67e61c217a73614f0d052e4303f53c3490","citations":["euclid-1-cn-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the angle CBA be subtracted from each; therefore the remaining angle ABE is equal to the remaining angle ABD, [[C.N. 3](/principles/euclid-1-cn-3)] the less to the greater: which is impossible. Therefore BE is not in a straight line with CB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将角度 CBA 从每个角度中减去; 因此剩余角度 ABE 等于剩余角度 ABD, 数量小于数量大于数量: 这是不可能的。 因此 BE 并非直线为 CB 。 [[C.N. 3](/principles/euclid-1-cn-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-14.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-1-14","revisionId":"euclid-1-14@raw-8b836392cfbe66b7","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"58fa0f07d911ed3f27c056c0a1478e9d44eb63da2775281a03aca9a579161bbe","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that neither is any other straight line except BD. Therefore CB is in a straight line with BD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,除了BD,没有其他一条直线。 因此,CB直线为BD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-14.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-1-14","revisionId":"euclid-1-14@raw-8b836392cfbe66b7","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-14.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-14","revisionId":"euclid-1-14@raw-8b836392cfbe66b7","order":8,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a767bacf26447ac75c1864eb85eb90c16406ee2f0184be6b8ee076c3e1a38d5c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-14.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-14","revisionId":"euclid-1-14@raw-8b836392cfbe66b7","order":9,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"de65508da9d1598a53040337f0b084012c61807ae0e6b2d1f337c0015af17767","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一直线于线上一点出不同方两直线偕元线每旁作两角若每旁两角与两直角等即后出两线为一直线"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从同一条线上某一点向不同方向画一条直线。如果这两条直线和原来的直线在每一侧形成两个角，并且每一侧的两个角等于两个直角，那么后来出现的两条线是直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-14.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-14","revisionId":"euclid-1-14@raw-8b836392cfbe66b7","order":10,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c5a24e5d02feb5a629f3110f286cefdfc07844d972bd2e9b410ac9fcba9c3415","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"解曰：甲乙线于丙点上左出一线为丙丁右出一线为丙戊若甲丙戊甲丙丁两角与两直角等题言丁丙与丙戊是一直线"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"说明如下：线：甲乙 在点 丙 上，向左延伸的线是 丙丁，向右延伸的线是 丙戊。如果 甲丙戊甲丙丁 的两个角和两个直角是命题，则说明 丁丙 和 丙戊 是直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-14.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-1-14","revisionId":"euclid-1-14@raw-8b836392cfbe66b7","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b6d50d76a3057afaa7592991bd78a7f48e294dbdb06cda42490fe847bf4a7281","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：如云不然令别作一直线必从丁丙更引出一线或离戊而上为丁丙己或离戊而下为丁丙庚也若上于戊则甲丙线至丁丙己直线上为甲丙己甲丙丁两角此两角宜与两直角等〈本篇十三〉如此即甲丙戊甲丙丁两角与甲丙己甲丙丁两角亦等矣试减甲丙丁角而以甲丙戊与甲丙己两角较之果相等乎〈公论三〉夫甲丙己本小于甲丙戊而为其分今曰：相等是全与其分等也〈公论九〉若下于戊则甲丙线至丁丙庚直线上为甲丙庚甲丙丁两角此两角宜与两直角等〈本篇十三〉如此即甲丙庚甲丙丁两角与甲丙戊甲丙丁两角亦等矣试减甲丙丁角而以甲丙戊与甲丙庚较之果相等乎〈公论三〉夫甲丙戊实小于甲丙庚而为其分今曰：相等是全与其分等也〈公论九〉两者皆非则丁丙戊是一直线"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：如云不然令别作一直线必从丁丙更引出一线或离戊而上为丁丙己或离戊而下为丁丙庚也若上于戊则甲丙线至丁丙己直线上为甲丙己甲丙丁两角此两角宜与两直角等〈本篇十三〉如此即甲丙戊甲丙丁两角与甲丙己甲丙丁两角亦等矣试减甲丙丁角而以甲丙戊与甲丙己两角较之果相等乎〈公论三〉夫甲丙己本小于甲丙戊而为其分今曰：相等是全与其分等也〈公论九〉若下于戊则甲丙线至丁丙庚直线上为甲丙庚甲丙丁两角此两角宜与两直角等〈本篇十三〉如此即甲丙庚甲丙丁两角与甲丙戊甲丙丁两角亦等矣试减甲丙丁角而以甲丙戊与甲丙庚较之果相等乎〈公论三〉夫甲丙戊实小于甲丙庚而为其分今曰：相等是全与其分等也〈公论九〉两者皆非则丁丙戊是一直线"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-14.source","contentId":"euclid-1-14","revisionId":"euclid-1-14@raw-8b836392cfbe66b7","order":12,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4147ee95ae568b82d2e1956235313c0e730c3f519093a3d79d1d4f97bc8328ed","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.14/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.14\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-1-14:euclid-1-13:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-14","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-14.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-13","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.14","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.14/","sourceLabel":"I. 13"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1-14:euclid-1-post-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-14","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-14.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-post-4","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.14","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reade